# Build output of the verification apps under tools/ (built by tools/mkapk.sh).
tools/*/build/
# The debug signing key deliberately lives outside build/: build/ is deleted on every run, and a
# new key changes the APK signature, which makes `adb install -r` refuse with
# INSTALL_FAILED_UPDATE_INCOMPATIBLE and forces an uninstall between rebuilds.
tools/*/.signing/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
